<!--
  Google's own mark, as Google draws it.

  It used to be four arcs and a crossbar drawn by hand in a Canvas, which was close enough to
  recognise and not close enough to be right: the proportions were ours, not theirs. This is the
  real outline, so the button carries the mark people have been taught to look for rather than an
  impression of it.

  Arc flags are written out with spaces, "0 0 1" rather than "001". Both are legal SVG, and
  Android's path parser has not always agreed about the packed form.
-->
